# Text files are LF in every checkout. Registry file hashes and the CLI's lockfile hashes are
# computed from exact bytes, and Git for Windows (core.autocrlf) would otherwise check sources out
# as CRLF, so a registry built on Windows would differ from the one CI builds.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
